# frontend/public/lyrics/don't-judge-me.lrc

## Don't Judge Me (Gary De'Snake Fan Song) 完整双语LRC
[00:00.00]Don't Judge Me - Gary De'Snake (Zootopia 2 Fan Track)
[00:06.00]Slitherin' through the neon lights
[00:06.00:zh]我蜿蜒穿行在城市霓虹之下
[00:10.30]Whispers follow me every night
[00:10.30:zh]流言蜚语每一夜都紧紧跟随我
[00:14.00]'Cause I'm different, they call me "creep"
[00:14.00:zh]只因为我与众不同，他们便叫我怪人
[00:18.00]They point and laugh, I lose my sleep
[00:18.00:zh]众人指指点点、肆意嘲笑，让我彻夜难眠
[00:21.00]Maybe I'm cold-blooded, it's true
[00:21.00:zh]也许我确实是个冷血动物，我承认
[00:25.00]But my heart is warm if only they knew
[00:25.00:zh]可若他们知道，我的内心其实无比温热
[00:30.00]I've been framed, I've been blamed
[00:30.00:zh]我曾遭人陷害，也曾背负无端指责
[00:34.00]But I'm not the one playin' games
[00:34.00:zh]但玩弄心机、颠倒黑白的绝不是我
[00:38.00]I don't wanna run
[00:38.00:zh]我不想再一味逃避
[00:40.30]Just hear me say: I'm not your villain anyway
[00:40.30:zh]只求你听我说：无论如何，我都不是你们口中的反派

[00:52.00]Slitherin' through the neon lights
[00:52.00:zh]我蜿蜒穿行在城市霓虹之下
